From 83f430462c2f8c8559b3e073df8e1bbdcf76491d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guild Idler Patch <patch@guild-idler.local>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 06:35:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add two craft-only item sets: Guildmade (lvl 12, fills 11-17
 gap) and Masterwork (lvl 50, endgame chase)

- Audited every existing set's level/source first: confirmed all 8 raids
  already have a dedicated set (nothing to add), found two real gaps --
  no set-bonus gear anywhere in levels 11-17, and zero set-bonus gear
  reachable via Crafting at all.
- Guildmade Set (reqLevel 12, rare, 6 pieces): retrofits the 2
  pre-existing craftable bases (guildmade_blade/guildmade_band, already
  at reqLevel 12) with setId, adds 4 new pieces (helm/plate/boots/cloak)
  and their recipes to round out weapon/ring/helmet/chest/boots/cloak.
- Masterwork Set (reqLevel 50, legendary, 6 pieces): fully new, sitting
  between Empyrean (45) and Requiem (55) as a genuine crafting-only
  endgame chase. modsToPick=3 at modValue=14 vs. Guildmade's 2-pick/
  value-6 is the real differentiator, not just bigger flat numbers.

Confirmed via direct code reading (not assumed) that this needed zero
manager/schema changes: CraftingManager.craftGear already accepts any
resultDefId regardless of slot, and HeroManager.equipmentMods already
counts a craftable item's set membership via def.setId the same way as
any dropped item, independent of customMods. Purely content: 10 new
EquipmentDef entries, 10 new CraftingRecipeDef entries, 2 new ItemSet
entries, setId retrofit on the 2 existing Guildmade pieces.

Verified end-to-end at runtime: actually crafted one piece of each set
via the real CraftingManager.craftGear and confirmed correct customMods;
confirmed every piece resolves to a real EquipmentDef with correct
setId/reqLevel/rarity/slot; confirmed a recipe exists for every new
piece; equipped a full synthetic 6-piece Guildmade set on a real Hero
and confirmed HeroManager.equipmentMods applies the cumulative set
bonus through the real code path. Full tsc --noEmit and vite build pass
clean.
